  "zh": "椅子保加利亚分腿蹲",
  "en": "Bulgarian Split Squat"
 },
 "purpose": {
  "zh": "练前腿的大腿和屁股，一条腿也有劲",
  "en": "Builds the thigh and butt of your front leg for single-leg strength."
 },
